      <![CDATA[<h2 id="前言"><a href="#前言" class="headerlink" title="前言"></a>前言</h2><p>今天开始捣鼓 Git 和 GitHub  写点项目、学好版本控制</p><h2 id="成果展示"><a href="#成果展示" class="headerlink" title="成果展示"></a>成果展示</h2><p>先贴一张今天的成果图</p><p><img src="/pt/git.png" alt="Git 操作截图"></p><h2 id="Git-工作流实战"><a href="#Git-工作流实战" class="headerlink" title="Git 工作流实战"></a>Git 工作流实战</h2><p>操作流程</p><h3 id="1-克隆仓库到本地"><a href="#1-克隆仓库到本地" class="headerlink" title="1. 克隆仓库到本地"></a>1. 克隆仓库到本地</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> https://github.com/wldr114/school-lab-experiments</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 把远程仓库完整复制到本地，会自动创建本地目录</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-创建并切换到新分支"><a href="#2-创建并切换到新分支" class="headerlink" title="2. 创建并切换到新分支"></a>2. 创建并切换到新分支</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git checkout -b my-feature</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -b 表示创建新分支并切换过去</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># my-feature 是分支名，开发新功能最好别直接在 main 上改</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-查看改动"><a href="#3-查看改动" class="headerlink" title="3. 查看改动"></a>3. 查看改动</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git diff</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看工作区相对于暂存区的具体改动内容</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 用来确认自己改了什么，很实用的命令</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-暂存所有改动"><a href="#4-暂存所有改动" class="headerlink" title="4. 暂存所有改动"></a>4. 暂存所有改动</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git add .</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># . 表示把当前目录下所有改动加入暂存区（staging area）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># git add 之后，改动才算&quot;准备提交&quot;的状态</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="5-提交改动"><a href="#5-提交改动" class="headerlink" title="5. 提交改动"></a>5. 提交改动</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;更新 README.md&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -m 后面跟提交信息，描述这次改了什么</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 养成写清楚 commit message 的习惯很重要</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="6-推送到远程仓库"><a href="#6-推送到远程仓库" class="headerlink" title="6. 推送到远程仓库"></a>6. 推送到远程仓库</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git push -u origin my-feature</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># -u 表示把本地分支和远程分支关联起来（upstream）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># origin 是远程仓库的默认名称</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># my-feature 是要推送的分支名</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 关联之后，下次直接 git push 就可以</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="一些疑问：git-push-f-危不危险？"><a href="#一些疑问：git-push-f-危不危险？" class="headerlink" title="一些疑问：git push -f 危不危险？"></a>一些疑问：<code>git push -f</code> 危不危险？</h2><p><code>git push -f</code>（即 <code>git push --force</code>）会强行用本地的提交历史覆盖远程分支……</p><h2 id="今日总结"><a href="#今日总结" class="headerlink" title="今日总结"></a>今日总结</h2><p>学习了 Git 的基本工作流clone → 建分支 → 改代码 → diff 检查 → add 暂存 → commit 提交 → push 推送，这是日常开发的标准流程</p><p>以后坚持每天写代码、写博客，慢慢积累</p>]]>
